<title>GERMANY: Buba's Kuehbacher says &quot;Nothing happened&quot; at mtg.</title>
<headline>Buba's Kuehbacher says &quot;Nothing happened&quot; at mtg.</headline>
<dateline>ASCHAU, Germany 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Klaus-Dieter Kuehbacher said on Thursday that the central bank's regular meeting had been uneventful but declined to make any further comment.</p>
<p>&quot;Nothing happened. You will have to wait for the news conference,&quot; Kuehbacher told reporters afer the meeting.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank will hold a news conference starting at 1015 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
